      "math_academy_id": "q-82288",
      "problem": "Which of the following determinants are equal to $0?$\n\n$$\n|A|=|\\begin{aligned}7 & \\sqrt{2} & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 14 & 2\\sqrt{2} & 2\\end{aligned}|,\\,|B|=|\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 4 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}|,\\,|C|=|\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -1\\end{aligned}|\n$$",
